{"ref":"BDB, דִּבָּה","hw":"דִּבָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. whispering, defamation, evil report (</strong>? as that which glides stealthily<strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nu 14:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.18\">Pr 10:18</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Je 20:10</a> + 4 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.10\">Pr 25:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">Gn 37:2</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>whispering</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:14\" href=\"/Psalms.31.14\">ψ 31:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Je 20:10</a> (Hi Hup De Gf VB; yet cf. Che ψ)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>defamation</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.18\">Pr 10:18</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוציא</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>evil report</em>, specif. a (true) report of evil doing <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">Gn 37:2</a> (P) <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּבֵא אֶת־דִּבָּתָם רָעָה</span>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.10\">Pr 25:10</a> & <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.3\">Ez 36:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֵּֽעֲלוּ עַל־שְׂפֵת לָשׁוֹן וְדִבַּת־עָ֑ם</span>. unfavourable report of spies <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:32\" href=\"/Numbers.13.32\">Nu 13:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">14:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">37</a> (all P & all c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תוֹצִיא</span>; adj. <span dir=\"rtl\">רעה</span> only <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">14:37</a>).","next":"BDB, דִּבְיוֹנִים","prev":"BDB, דֹּב²"}